When you finish your beach picnic, please clean it up.

00:25:30.730 --> 00:25:42.280
That's one way we can be sure that years from now, your children will be able to enjoy the thrill of watching whales and maybe even hear the humpback sing.

00:25:44.230 --> 00:25:44.810
See you next time.

00:26:02.880 --> 00:26:03.140
Thank you.

00:26:55.050 --> 00:26:56.130
Simple song.

00:27:00.800 --> 00:27:05.920
And I sail away, sail away, sail away.

